WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.094
Bring together the existing offer, audience evidence, format choice, usable sample, flow, ownership, trust checks, business review and planned test.

00:00:09.094 --> 00:00:12.277
Keep the same project and learning question.

00:00:12.277 --> 00:00:20.916
Check whether the person understands the promise, accesses the sample, completes the intended action and finds the stated support.

00:00:20.916 --> 00:00:25.009
Use appropriately permitted participation and avoid unnecessary personal data.

00:00:25.009 --> 00:00:32.739
If no external participant is available, document a scenario with the assumed role, inputs, steps and limits.

00:00:32.739 --> 00:00:35.012
Our teaching case is fictional.

00:00:35.012 --> 00:00:39.559
It does not report a real tester or a sale.

00:00:39.559 --> 00:00:42.742
A favorable opinion alone cannot establish usability.

00:00:42.742 --> 00:00:53.655
Keep the test conditions and evidence standard visible, and retain the starting sample so the final correction can be compared with the original problem.
